<title>USA: EMERGENCY WEATHER CONDITIONS -  WSC - 09-JUN.</title>
<headline>EMERGENCY WEATHER CONDITIONS -  WSC - 09-JUN.</headline>
<text>
<p>Typhoon Nestor, with 105 mph winds, is east of the Mariana Islands in the western Pacific near 15.4n/149.4e, moving north northwest at 4 mph. A gradual turn to the northwest is expected during the next 48 hours, and during this time top winds are expected to increase to near 140 mph, making Nestor an extreme threat to shipping.  </p>
<p>There are no further statements at this time.</p>
</text>
